<title>USA: EPIX Medical Inc Q1 turns to loss.</title>
<headline>EPIX Medical Inc Q1 turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31,</p>
<p>						     1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenues				   $293,180    $2,970,000</p>
<p> Operating expenses		    2,339,818     2,186,523</p>
<p> Operating income (loss)	    (2,046,638)	783,477</p>
<p> Interest expense			   (9,944)     (155,820)</p>
<p> Interest income			   228,619	  10,516</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		   ( 1,827,963)	638,173</p>
<p> Net income (loss) EPS		     (0.24)	   0.08</p>
<p> Wghtd avg shares			7,737,000     7,711,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1996 revenues consisted of up front license fees received from the Company's strategic partner for the rights to commercialize MS-325 in Japan.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
